1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:18,471
On a bright, sunny day, a rabbit and a
tortoise began a race.

2
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:24,351
As the race began, the rabbit ran very
fast,

3
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:40,091
and when she looked back, the tortoise
was still far behind.

4
00:00:41,090 --> 00:01:00,331
Proud of her speed, the rabbit thought,
"I have plenty of time."

5
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:22,511
She lay down under a big tree for a
short rest, but she fell fast asleep.

6
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:35,196
Meanwhile, the tortoise kept going,
without stopping and without hurrying,

7
00:01:35,196 --> 00:01:40,091
with steady, disciplined steps.

8
00:01:41,090 --> 00:01:58,441
When the rabbit woke up, it was already
very late.

9
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:15,061
The tortoise was already near the finish
line.

10
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:34,549
The rabbit ran with all her strength,
but she could not get there first. The

11
00:02:34,549 --> 00:02:39,901
tortoise won the race.

12
00:02:40,900 --> 00:03:00,584
Speed alone is not enough. Steady
discipline, patience and focus lead to

13
00:03:00,584 --> 00:03:02,771
success.

